.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:25:The deep review loop has 4 phases: initialization, iteration (repeated), synthesis, and save. The YAML workflow manages the lifecycle. The `@deep-review` agent (LEAF-only, no WebFetch) executes individual review iterations with fresh context each time.
.opencode/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-review/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md:31:- Validating the 4-phase lifecycle and lineage protocol against current behavior.
